~ start
set wants_to_leave = false
Grandpa: Want to stay a little longer, or go?
- Stay => END
- Go
	set wants_to_leave = true
	=> END

~ welcome
Grandpa: You did it, Sarah! Listen to that mill running again.
Grandpa: Smell that fresh cider? It brought the whole town back for a taste.
Grandpa: Go enjoy the festival, kiddo. You can play again at the orchard or the mill.
Grandpa: Come find me when you're ready to head home.
=> END
